    promptsEn: ['Why does the Bible say a good name beats great riches?', 'Is “train up a child… he won’t depart” a guarantee? What if a child wanders?', 'What does the Bible say about borrowing and debt?', 'Why is befriending a hot-tempered person dangerous?', 'What does “humility and the fear of the LORD” mean?'],
